Error [E0003]: Expected decimal places inside `:Fixed( )`
  --> tests/ui/fixed_interpolation_missing_precision.jet:3:25
    |
  3 |     print("{value:Fixed()}")
    |                         ^
 Why: `:Fixed(n)` takes one nonnegative integer literal
 Fix: Write a precision such as `:Fixed(2)`
